description: Swift style for LLimit sources
globs: "**/*.swift"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Swift

- `final class` + `@MainActor` + `ObservableObject` for stores (`AccountStore`, `RefreshCoordinator`)
- Models are `struct` + `Codable` + `Hashable` / `Identifiable`
- Provider-specific auth stays in `*AuthSource` / `ClaudeOAuthLogin` / `CLILoginRunner` (Cursor uses `agent login` + keychain snapshot)
- Views take `@EnvironmentObject`; they do not open files or hit the network
- Prefer existing helpers (`PortUtil`, `Keychain`, `AuthSource`) over new I/O
- Do not add Swift packages, SPM dependencies, or an Xcode project unless asked
- Do not log `Data`, URL query items, or OAuth fields
